{"v":4,"catch":"『魔法使的新娘』首款視覺小說遊戲登場！","desc":"▶故事概要\n夜色籠罩的倫敦，一名非人類者孤獨地生活著。\n某個夜晚，他遇見了迷失在霧中，尋求幫助的少女。\n\n少女失去了記憶，也不明白自己為何身處此地。\n將她從黑暗中救出後，兩人也因此成為朋友。\n\n非人類者名為索爾，這是他人生中第一次結識朋友。\n為了幫助她找回失去的記憶，他踏上旅途，\n前往妖精之間所傳聞的「荊棘魔法使艾利亞斯」以及「智世」所在之地。","publisher":"Bushiroad","release":"2025-10-02","genres":["冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 1.0GB / Switch 1.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/20c51d2ce85cf2fd5936d2e7c694b7663c6d587d7f1e32a22bceb3a2696bf05e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6cbae3424ac089a2a1ed6cfede7c3a2178be6d2139407dd55234c76af1c4cc14.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a15872653593a834f6cf52a33a521ac14ab0615d4c49c4a4e7a5fe714c429be6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3d5703ee46a455a39e5e81414abfc4e8f997a221afac53c4ca5d2db90ccc4eef.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d7488904c95d51ee2813581bccd6adf877fbaa469c4866f62301ed065cd31443.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3e3ab33619a011c6e27fe4183cee2d495b84d3db0e44545c3cf1e5eaacbeab61.jpg"],"titleId":"01008d101ec40000","dlc":[]}